I see nothing amusing in that statement. And in the third place, I am not a socialist. But I will mention another reason. I was not going to speak about this but my hon. friend forces me to do so. I did not intend to quote the pope, and I do not suppose he is an authority whom the hon. gentleman would accept. But the pope was quoted the other day by my hon. friend from Labeille; and the pope, who is an authority so far as I am concerned, has condemned three things in his encyclical.
